<!DOCTYPE html PUBLIC "-//W3C//DTD XHTML 1.0 Transitional//EN"
        "http://www.w3.org/TR/xhtml1/DTD/xhtml1-transitional.dtd">
<html xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
<head>
    <meta http-equiv="Content-Type" content="text/html; charset=UTF-8"/>
</head>
<body>

<p>Dear $userName, </p>

<p>
    You are receiving the final notification as your account $accountName is to expire tomorrow.
    Please note that no further notice will be sent.
    <br/>
    You need to <a href="$host/Myaccount.html?link=$link" target="_self" style="color: #1f4f8f;">renew your
    subscription</a> or <a href="mailto:$supportEmail">contact</a> your relationship manager before $expireDate
    because after that your account will be automatically inactivated.
</p>

</body>
</html>